    "notes": "# Otosora 0.8.8\n\n## Windows\n- When Windows Smart App Control is on, Otosora no longer tries to update itself. Smart App Control refuses to start any Otosora file downloaded from the internet, because Otosora isn't code-signed yet, so the update would leave an app that won't open. The update notice now says so. To update, turn Smart App Control off in Windows Security, under App & browser control.\n",
